{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "5dbe797940d1ead98d3a1c0cd45566a685f0a95c6133d3621999976920d9eb8a", "ja": "私たち、閃光☆HANABI団です！", "zh": "我们是『闪光☆HANABI团』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cbcf13cdf730886b06c307a884691438a297bfe610a4c5505a5fa27c016f5d0a", "ja": "社長から渡された新曲を手に紗代子、海美、\n奈緒、美奈子、のり子の5人で新ユニットを\n結成しようと考えるプロデューサー。\nライブのテーマは夏祭りと決まり、やる気\n十分。海辺のステージを目指すことに。", "zh": "制作人拿着社长所交付的新歌，\n计划由五名偶像组成新团体，\n成员有纱代子、海美、奈绪、美奈子、法子。\n得知演唱会的主题定为夏日祭典，\n众人都充满干劲，决定要打造海边舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "de03ca937f92b8b792e95ab84318ed48d2e23b594ae4b810ad5e9e0cfdfef733", "ja": "なあなあ、このごろ暑すぎひん！？\nもう汗がマーライオンみたいになって大変やわ！", "zh": "欸欸，最近也太热了吼！？\n汗流得像鱼尾狮喷泉，我都快热疯啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "f1ad47ca5da1feb032c9ccce4fbb9ce07598374531ab1af9144be0da14a83c47", "ja": "えっ、マーライオンはおおげさじゃないかな。\nそれを言うなら小龍包くらい……？", "zh": "咦，说成鱼尾狮也太夸张了吧。\n真要说的话大概是小笼包那种程度……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "5e725d50dd7190dddfaf87d93d449f2de6e00473902ba4b27d8cf1185f0c2cc7", "ja": "そうそう！　ジュワッと蒸されて中からあっつ～い\n汁が……ってなんでやねん！　余計ひどいわ！", "zh": "嘿呀嘿呀！用烧滚滚的水气蒸熟，\n里头流出热～呼呼的汤汁……搞什么呀！越说越热啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "d3365c84123b6e29b8e8e26de2750b14c7b3a91fd4959548e89b15cdbca5354b", "ja": "あははっ！　最近、ずっと雨が続いてたせいかな？\n本当に蒸し暑いよね。ふぅ……。", "zh": "哈哈！可能是因为最近一直在下雨吧？\n真的很闷热呢，呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "d95755a20eec00406f01435ff97ad9e7d02a97e71856eddbb654cd6a0564e7f2", "ja": "奈緒、美奈子、おはよっ！\nどしたどした、そんなゲッソリして～！", "zh": "奈绪、美奈子，早啊！\n怎么啦怎么啦，那么无精打采的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "fffa2077e48a8bc84e87421542ecb1fc6f90c307447d9c3b0f9a9b6e19344d6f", "ja": "あ、のり子ちゃん。いつも元気だね。\nその元気わけてほしいな～、なんて。", "zh": "啊，小法，你总是活力充沛耶。\n真希望能分一些活力给我～开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "ba0eabf0ee04014970844cea68cb18020674dca7ae384a770dcef557d4ec57e5", "ja": "私ら、夏バテやねん。\nのり子は暑いの平気なん？", "zh": "我们都热到没力啦。\n法子你都不怕热吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "677e9b5a958c44733f66b7b2e144e45866f59d4cda131b70dcf582444a56fa14", "ja": "うん！　アタシ、暑いのけっこう好きなんだよね。\nたぎってくるっていうの？　プロレスと同じで♪", "zh": "嗯！我还挺喜欢大热天的喔。\n该说会让人热血沸腾起来吗？就跟摔角一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "84af80941077e589d7264e8a6e2adde0e3e5a1cce6a61303e7d3ef76477a981c", "ja": "いや、だいぶちゃうと思うねんけど……。\nああ～、いますぐ銭湯でサッパリしたいわぁ。", "zh": "不是吧，我觉得差很多耶……\n唉～好想立刻去澡堂清爽一下啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1075_p", "source_sha256": "843290b4330c7c1f7453f0c086d97020f916c31533aeec026f4fa4054425fa5b", "ja": "（さて、新曲に合わせてメンバーを選出して\nみたけど……みんな、もう集まってるかな？）", "zh": "（那么，我配合新歌挑选出了成员……\n不知道大家都到了没？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c8070eb4af7e6ec2dd07693bde8d37e1ef5daaac2a2c521369bfea63d5e8ced9", "ja": "……おお、奈緒、美奈子、のり子、お疲れさま！", "zh": "……哦哦，奈绪、美奈子、法子，你们辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "64b73be168466757de1f8e6fcf463215240bfc6f5da5108b79e9d89a51bb5a56", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "b6f4b1216555f300c2ea6f23bfe9229c4f5c832846b6865816ab9821cd23b5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです！", "zh": "辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "7cb66b7a642604feaf37791ebef5aec14d1d539910500de10f202831f2e7a017", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "d3181597515bd99c427e2e5d9535c21703d36a6905a09b0083e8e3e3a2f7400e", "ja": "お疲れ！", "zh": "辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "843f876ec74760eb4ca1af2e008c3fe85517f55d986b6704559cd4e858b5b174", "ja": "今日みんなに集まってもらったのは……あれ？\nあとふたり来てないな。", "zh": "今天之所以要你们集合，是为了……奇怪？\n还有两个人没到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "0fb84c7a528cebb3043b3eaa900728cada70163b26af9a13fc66a4e85b226d33", "ja": "あ、ウワサをすれば、かな？", "zh": "啊，这就叫「说人人到」吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "739acff7c065f374aed86467ca66e5b0dd4c447f176d4ecc4b39034cd3c1a968", "ja": "お疲れさまです！\nすみません、お待たせしちゃいましたか！？", "zh": "辛苦了！\n抱歉，你们等很久吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "4a8f61fa07cb84d5becf3a88491a3c876684c4d5b617843df5d01f3775cfef39", "ja": "ホントだ、みんなもう集まってる～。\n……ていうか、私もココでよかったんだよね？", "zh": "真的耶，大家都已经到了～\n……话说，我也是被叫来这里的没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6927faab792aa2697ebabbe08a86c648a2997d1b1d37497c64a9a30053ef4bea", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま。\nああ、海美もこの部屋で間違いないぞ。", "zh": "你们两个都辛苦了。\n嗯，海美也是来这间房间没错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7d39f9af0cef942db20b7a24088db9caa91eca332f08dbc64d6fba2ada46c483", "ja": "よし、これで全員揃ったな。\nとりあえずみんなにはこの曲を聴いて欲しいんだ。", "zh": "很好，这样就全员到齐了。\n那就请大家先听听看这首歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "a5eb985160de7253d410f92ffd6a9d6611368a0c29b7ba5fd6af3f622d48cc4d", "ja": "わあ～っ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "ea5e53930d8450efbb3065f9c670d700dc434b5747ba5f9c045ba567b8004544", "ja": "わあーっ☆", "zh": "哇～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "2fa49c05f185013fcdadb6cbfc282928ef2984e1aabb91bde391a841ebd3623d", "ja": "おお～っ！", "zh": "哦哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "884614759a69eeb78bb4594fd55366f732098a2aac5b8ae19525f08788a0b758", "ja": "へえ～っ！", "zh": "哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "11f54ba443bd55adeb5810786085139705bddc0636771b2491f9a1b1698e0742", "ja": "ええなぁ♪", "zh": "好棒呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "03bef293047be72a9e98d180f341a8ffa67b4c493255fca82bca1a10497d7a5e", "ja": "いい曲だろ？　ジメジメした梅雨を吹き飛ばす、\n夏らしくて元気な曲って感じがしないか！", "zh": "这首歌很棒吧？你们不觉得这是一首能吹散潮湿梅雨，\n充满夏日气息的活力歌曲吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "dc0a485b9c4fe38fc3fb20e23df98f394bc9d558478e11ad6452d11c60306d0a", "ja": "わかります！　この曲に、私たち5人で挑戦するって\nことですよね……私、なんだか燃えてきました！", "zh": "我能理解！你是要我们五人来挑战这首歌对吧……\n我开始热血沸腾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1070910ec51e361531dc06830193501a5021cb1fd4829a3ddbe16ad194aa96f7", "ja": "その通りだ。みんなには、この新曲を引っさげて\nユニットのお披露目公演をしてもらおうと考えている。", "zh": "没错，我想让你们主打这首新曲，\n举办团体首次亮相公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ed6914d968ba998f4f77419873ff2ace8a305c3a3f004f8626a170c587b4d169", "ja": "ジメジメした空気を払い飛ばす、\nにぎやかなステージにしよう！", "zh": "让我们打造一场活泼热闹的表演，\n将潮湿空气一扫而空吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1031_null", "source_sha256": "d1e885e88af25a7e26500f47b74793ad3a2448412a26f93fcc22f6e480b4fac2", "ja": "……ドドーン……。", "zh": "……咻──砰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "ab6c08253685284720f73259c63af8ab9ea2cc21dea9901a242295d43978e7b0", "ja": "ん……？\nなんや、外で大きい音せえへんかった？", "zh": "嗯……？\n啥呀，刚才外面好像有很大的声音吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "72b3bb157bd7d537b5d062220b864321078c17014f3c4217f61a82a65dada276", "ja": "ああ……そういえば、劇場の近くで\nお祭りがあるって、音無さんが言ってたな。", "zh": "对了……这么说来，\n之前音无小姐提到最近剧场附近要办祭典。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "892f6375d93b379ea644a5010d5a2bc3a0b6e37a7019b968779bd5f874764d7f", "ja": "お祭り！？　わああああっ、行きたい行きたい\n行きたーいっ！　私、行ってくる☆", "zh": "祭典！？哇啊啊啊啊，我想去我想去我想去～！\n我去看看就回来☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1035_027say", "source_sha256": "8c11928c6fe2c82e2a3f4246c4efaef2ae26293393dbe2bd3fee6f33da29393c", "ja": "あっ！　海美、待って……\nも、もういなくなっちゃった。", "zh": "啊！海美，等等……\n已、已经跑掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "1f4a003fa972049a818244364e78270db7ea5a1c2bf0c2256e8fb09bf7cbc620", "ja": "{$P$}さん。せっかくですし、\nみんなで行きませんか？　おいしいご飯があるかも♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生。难得有祭典，\n要不要大家一起去看看？说不定会有好吃的东西♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "6e293c19b34b638b99f6cb821acad8b7ed0fbabf1b064044136d11364d7ef75e", "ja": "そうだな……ちょっと、様子を見に行ってみるか！", "zh": "也好……那我们去稍微瞧瞧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "02b0138f8c83d7014bc20f9ab5bb08e08045625c3e81e9cfd0c1228d4920b7ba", "ja": "やった♪\nお祭り、お祭り、イェーイ！", "zh": "太棒了♪\n祭典、祭典，耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "3e1d90ed9303aa63d55670901a7b89b1ef395370199d1dde5e240041492f51a9", "ja": "うわ～、ほんまにお祭りやん！\nあ、たこ焼き食べよ♪", "zh": "哇～真的在办祭典呀！\n啊，我去吃个章鱼烧嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1040_027say", "source_sha256": "3d79510dc3d0580e3211e347d8a9256c5ba92ba5bedd69a57f8a15f2fa70ae15", "ja": "あっ、たい焼きもありますね♪\n{$P$}、行ってきていいですか？", "zh": "啊，也有鲷鱼烧呢♪\n{$P$}，我可以去看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "73e56ab8d71f673a5107d461429c6242d5d1a126c831b12a32ebeee65796944d", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n俺は先に、海美を探してくるよ。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以。\n我先去找海美喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1042_null", "source_sha256": "fe6b5028ea39b2cbecdabf26b6c46bcc30834f052ad9bdbc736e793551c59419", "ja": "ドーン…", "zh": "砰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "91c52911e7498bd633462ba3efd5925fc39dccbf9fa481495fb1b17214d0927e", "ja": "わーっ、花火キレーイ！\nみてみて、{$P$}☆", "zh": "哇～烟火好美～！\n你看你看，{$P$}☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "962f8ea88fe554d85f7677e7deb970811bbac997ca90215e651cb1d87f3b91f4", "ja": "やれやれ、海美の方から来てくれて助かったよ。\nみんなも戻ってきたみたいだな。", "zh": "真是的，幸好海美你自己跑来找我了。\n大家好像也回来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1045_019min", "source_sha256": "b2a071432b928ae4b924d6331ae716b35c43314c56e800c7f0087ccd538e3096", "ja": "わっほーい！　たくさん買ってきましたよ。\nみんなで食べましょうっ！", "zh": "哇哦──！我买了很多东西喔。\n大家一起来吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1046_null", "source_sha256": "133b7fc94593f3d4d80b2ef4b8ec8c7cd2f3af6b5bfc439134fb9530aba61385", "ja": "ドドーン…", "zh": "咻──砰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "3f8c43516be881fd9b782d76c9be44ecaa4661711b27b6a26f9813dc214853cc", "ja": "今日、晴れてて良かったね！\n雨が降ってたら、花火が見られなかったもんね。", "zh": "幸好今天有放晴！\n要是下雨就没有烟火可以看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1048_027say", "source_sha256": "0f5e16dd300cc7cfc54d3d8c3955a32547f9a12643f839dc5addfd17c04049a4", "ja": "そうだ……{$P$}。今回の公演って、\n曲とメンバー以外、まだ決まってないんですよね？", "zh": "对了……{$P$}。\n这次公演除了歌曲和成员，其他都还没定案对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "b5b9ba163cb370bd7409aff18c819014d288541666f6808d6e5d25c5e49d8f6d", "ja": "そうだな。\nユニット名や方向性は、早めに決めたいんだが……。", "zh": "对啊。\n我是希望能早点决定团体名称和路线啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1050_null", "source_sha256": "133b7fc94593f3d4d80b2ef4b8ec8c7cd2f3af6b5bfc439134fb9530aba61385", "ja": "ドドーン…", "zh": "咻──砰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1051_027say", "source_sha256": "37c36f2610afcaba5ab212255341520486c971d089d8e4b1e01fb4419684d50e", "ja": "だったら、花火をテーマにするのはどうですか？\nお祭りみたいに、にぎやかで元気って意味で！", "zh": "既然如此，你觉得用烟火当主题怎么样？\n意涵是有如祭典般热闹又有活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1052_029umi", "source_sha256": "e721055ae896936afa400cf91685ab732b1ee9d0bb1d586c6a403750badfdfd2", "ja": "はいはいっ！　私、それなら女子力高めに、\nアルファベットでHANABIとかにしたい！", "zh": "选我选我！那我想要有女子力很高的感觉，\n像是把「烟火」用英文字母写成「HANABI」之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1053_037nao", "source_sha256": "c892e9440193c26811aba2117b019e730a46bf360fb3aee12d2662885e920b0e", "ja": "アルファベットって女子力高いん？\n女子力やったら、線香花火とかとちゃうん？", "zh": "英文字母的女子力很高吗？\n要说女子力，应该是线香烟火之类的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1054_043nor", "source_sha256": "6704474e000d1cff21c9ad34c8b01d3aee6eedee22839a0b756cda5672a76f27", "ja": "あははっ！\nなんか、すっごく弱々しくなってるけど、いいの？", "zh": "哈哈！\n用「线香」听起来很虚耶，行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1055_p", "source_sha256": "b31c6614cfdc386983c19eb89145bca937db28313677c77fff2feb033ec3358b", "ja": "線香花火か……紗代子たちなら、きらめく方の\n閃光かもしれないな。うん、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "线香啊……不然改用一样念成「SENKOU」的「闪光」呢？\n嗯，很适合耀眼的纱代子你们对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1056_p", "source_sha256": "99c904a104a1e5e54a5bd93d87d16c23b65f9e66138f603c514c4949bf89e775", "ja": "閃光HANABI……いや、5人いるから\n『閃光☆HANABI団』とか！", "zh": "闪光HANABI……不，既然有五个人，\n那就叫『闪光☆HANABI团』怎么样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1057_029umi", "source_sha256": "277f9d70d368310e343e12974459b702ff16f39f4ee5eb755c81325752f59f77", "ja": "うわーっ、なんかカッコいいかもっ！？\nそれにしようよっ、{$P$}☆", "zh": "哇～听起来好像很帅！？\n就叫这个吧，{$P$}☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1058_027say", "source_sha256": "5805822dae6fb3daa213aecb0460b9ccce8189b8a38b526c99df15d1ed3114f7", "ja": "それじゃ、ユニット名は『閃光☆HANABI団』で\n決まりで！　あ、ライブはどんな感じがいいかな……。", "zh": "那么，团体名称就决定叫做『闪光☆HANABI团』！\n啊，那演唱会要走什么路线呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1059_029umi", "source_sha256": "4053b9ccca08a52fb96cd35c47460a63cf1216b0fc34c849db2525e295fc392e", "ja": "はいはい！　私、海でライブやりたい！\n海にステージを作って、そこでやるとかどうかなっ！？", "zh": "选我选我！我想在海边办演唱会！\n在海边搭舞台，然后在那里开唱怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1060_p", "source_sha256": "48c5dd7bf7a2f55ca941c82b21e20a7fc08a38558189892f93242744f97cee7b", "ja": "へえ、夏らしくてなかなかいいな。\nしかし準備が結構大変なような……。", "zh": "哦，这样很有夏天的感觉，挺不错的。\n但准备起来好像很费工夫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1061_027say", "source_sha256": "310d502fa3f3c96b67fb57364638224b2e2c3c4a9ea68675498ec25521b5e683", "ja": "いえ、私たちのユニットですから、\nそれくらいへっちゃらです！　ね、海美！", "zh": "不会的，对我们这个团体来说，\n这是小事一桩！对吧，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1062_029umi", "source_sha256": "c780022764cf59a3335948a3530b7af7923ba01c3c43674ff216b53f1cd28b9b", "ja": "うんうんっ！\n大丈夫だよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n没问题啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1063_019min", "source_sha256": "1b5e2a8f304cf42137db66c7e1f07d3987696ae12480be7146b7d0e37c1c6baa", "ja": "せっかくだから、お祭りみたいなライブにしたいよね。\nミックスナッツの時みたいに、屋台とか出して……。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我想办像祭典一样的演唱会。\n就像『Mix Nuts』的时候那样，摆些摊贩之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1064_037nao", "source_sha256": "e4736e5e533270c87eb43a92d9e6119b8c654635b0ce58f820efae200cd2b026", "ja": "夏祭りライブ、めっちゃええやん！\nなあ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "夏日祭典演唱会，听起来超棒的嘿！\n对不对啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1065_043nor", "source_sha256": "31f5f2315c9a7627efa405f0d10350757be4c2524cca3d854e4b536e5aa34517", "ja": "あはは、みんなすっごくやる気みたいだね！\nなんとかなるよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "哈哈，大家好像都很有干劲呢！\n总会有办法搞定啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1066_p", "source_sha256": "0148f76f06832a38685aaab78390e49d30a2426a69ab18d5ffe59232d01b30a8", "ja": "う～ん……。\nまあ、そうだな。なんとかしてみるか！", "zh": "唔～嗯……\n好吧，这样也不错，那我来设法安排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1067_027say", "source_sha256": "9b23f2da14ac974032d5be316b9acffe3d74e573bb7b99f572bca062671a5a6f", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n{$P$}、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "谢谢你！\n{$P$}，万事拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_01_1068_p", "source_sha256": "bff984680c155b7ddb0efe8115864c586303df34c42159f1ecb9a9d012b66b1a", "ja": "ああ。みんな、頼りにしてるぞ！", "zh": "嗯。各位，我就指望你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
